  "tillverkar_beskrivning": {
    "text": "Nomo's horizontal folding roof system lets you enjoy the outdoors, even when it rains. The smart design of the curved fabric profiles ensures elegant water drainage. Add glass or wooden sliding walls and LED lighting for extra comfort. The folding roof can be opened fully, allowing you to enjoy maximum light. The folding fabric is made of PVC and is 100% waterproof. The curved fabric profiles also means there is great drainage so you stay nice and dry during a shower. With a maximum width of 5.5 m, a depth of 7 m and a surface area of 38.5 m² per module, Nomo offers endless options. The maximum height of 3 m and sturdy posts of 15 x 15 cm ensure a robust and spacious design. Will you opt for a lean-to or for a fully self-supporting structure? Nomo offers an elegant and practical solution. Opt for glass sliding walls, built-in screens all around and sustainable LED lighting for even more comfort.",
    "kalla": {
      "domän": "harol.com",
      "url": "https://www.harol.com/en/products/pergolas/folding-roofs/nomo/"
    },
    "kanal_typ": "tillverkare",
